.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH QUIPU-POLICY 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-policy \- Draft an advisory policy from an exemplar, or backtest one
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu policy\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Draft an advisory policy from an exemplar, or backtest one
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
quipu\-policy\-draft(1)
Draft advisory policy Turtle from an exemplar and an intent
.TP
quipu\-policy\-backtest(1)
Backtest a candidate policy over recorded transactions
.TP
quipu\-policy\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
